      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In patients with ischemic heart disease impairments in blood plasma lipid spectrum were more distinct in the chronic form of the disease. At the same time, the phospholipid composition was altered in thrombocytes as compared with that of persons free of ischemic heart disease and of stenosing coronary atherosclerosis."},
